sequenceDiagram
    participant FC as Fleet Control
    participant AC as Agent Control
    participant Agent as Managed Agent

    Note over FC,Agent: Initial deployment
    FC->>AC: Desired state (version X + config)
    AC->>AC: No agent running — install required
    AC->>Agent: Install and start agent
    Agent-->>AC: Health check: healthy
    AC-->>FC: Status: healthy, version X

    Note over FC,Agent: Upgrade
    FC->>AC: New desired state (version Y)
    AC->>AC: Running version X ≠ desired Y
    AC->>Agent: Rolling upgrade to version Y
    Agent-->>AC: Health check: healthy
    AC-->>FC: Status: healthy, version Y

    Note over FC,Agent: Continuous reconciliation
    FC->>AC: Config update (new setting)
    AC->>Agent: Apply config change
    Agent-->>AC: Health check: healthy
    AC-->>FC: Status: config applied
